        "title": "The diagram shows the manufacturing process for making sugar from sugar cane. Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LhDHdzwMtoRiYOxNABKlak9Cgcc\"><em><strong>The diagram shows the manufacturing process for making sugar from sugar cane.</strong></em><em> </em><em><strong>Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.</strong></em></div>\n</div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 1 - Sugar Production from Sugar Cane</em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-ZE0EderokonhrdxOGQOlbqckg8g\">Đề b&agrave;i Sugar Production from Sugar Cane y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả quy tr&igrave;nh sản xuất đường từ m&iacute;a.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-K5pSdLrQpoF8acxi6Wrln1gigeg\"><strong>Nội dung:</strong> Paraphrase đề Sugar Production from Sugar Cane với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;: c&aacute;c bước sản xuất đường - từ c&acirc;y m&iacute;a.</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JEbsd2QXSos0HUxGNcHlF0ntgab\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HVebdDKPDoNbSExDutel4LdQgeo\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng đề process, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh đưa ra c&aacute;i nh&igrave;n tổng quan về c&aacute;c bước trong quy tr&igrave;nh:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-X1D8dbfFNoPW2sxATZhlWa40gwb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>quy tr&igrave;nh bao gồm 7 bước.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-X1D8dbfFNoPW2sxATZhlWa40gwb\" data-list=\"bullet\">biến đổi m&iacute;a th&ocirc; th&agrave;nh đường tinh luyện.</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LWwUd95Owok4CXxyF5blHSeIgoh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>bắt đầu bằng việc trồng m&iacute;a v&agrave; kết th&uacute;c bằng việc sấy kh&ocirc; v&agrave; l&agrave;m m&aacute;t sản phẩm cuối c&ugrave;ng.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-C0uhdsgGwoKI77xgKkZlSFkigwd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LqvhdFeMUoZxZrxNwSilgmVJgBN\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WLkcdtYmdoCbPRx82yGlwGHNgjc\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i một c&aacute;ch r&otilde; r&agrave;ng, bằng c&aacute;ch<strong> chia c&aacute;c bước trong quy tr&igrave;nh th&agrave;nh 2 phần</strong>:</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LqvhdFeMUoZxZrxNwSilgmVJgBN\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P06AdwVAioetUFx6MzilxCvvgvf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Yu4MdOZ1JoLYsQxGQNRlpNuOgsb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MfFWd7rzNoOfyax6As5l5WbjgPb\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1:</strong><strong> 2 bước đầu của quy tr&igrave;nh</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FvEYdRrSGo3Jqcxt55alQorzgYd\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HCqrdLxYKoROV2xhGT9lb4lugad\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>m</strong><strong>&iacute;a</strong> (<em>sugar cane</em>) được trồng trong khoảng từ 12 đến 18 th&aacute;ng</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CUnldpRzRoCe4ZxJKGvlXpXcg6z\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>khi đ&atilde; trưởng th&agrave;nh, m&iacute;a được thu hoạch bằng cả <strong>thiết bị cơ kh&iacute; </strong>(<em>mechanical equipment</em>) v&agrave; <strong>lao động thủ c&ocirc;ng</strong> (<em>manual labour</em>)</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QMAFdDrSuoIxkgxJsi8lWhBBg48\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>m&iacute;a trải qua&nbsp;<strong>qu&aacute; tr&igrave;nh nghiền</strong> (<em>crushing</em>) v&agrave; <strong>nước m&iacute;a</strong> (<em>juice</em>) được chiết xuất bằng c&aacute;c <strong>con lăn lớn</strong> (<em>large rollers</em>)</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HKUodfK9xogC0MxTp2Wlp70ng9f\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QcskdIE6RoFckExwCkClFQLsglf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UcPzdqFBqofBD1xRL88lNtv5gP1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 2</strong><strong>: 2 bước c&ograve;n lại của quy tr&igrave;nh</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UcPzdqFBqofBD1xRL88lNtv5gP1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YpJRdIWcboSBrexsMwRl6X1Sgag\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 2 như sau:</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VwnxdTHV3odWiwxY4cvlMTVygtb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>nước &eacute;p đi qua<strong> bộ lọc đ&aacute; v&ocirc;i</strong> (<em>limestone filter</em>) cho <strong>qu&aacute; tr&igrave;nh tinh chế</strong> (<em>purification</em>), sau đ&oacute; đi v&agrave;o <strong>m&aacute;y bay hơi </strong>(<em>evaporator</em>) v&agrave; biến th&agrave;nh<strong> xi r&ocirc;</strong> (<em>syrup</em>) nhờ <strong>nhiệt</strong> (<em>heat</em>)</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KMTxdFbLAoppR9xsa8vlCQJFgve\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>xi r&ocirc; được xử l&yacute; trong&nbsp;<strong>m&aacute;y ly t&acirc;m</strong> (<em>centrifuge</em>) để t&aacute;ch <strong>tinh thể đường</strong> (<em>sugar crystal</em>)</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JzQHdtDtOoUXGDxWRlQl6Oqdgxe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>t</strong>inh thể đường trải qua <strong>qu&aacute; tr&igrave;nh sấy kh&ocirc; v&agrave; l&agrave;m m&aacute;t</strong> (<em>drying and cooling</em>) để tạo ra đường th&agrave;nh phẩm</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
